  "details": "As a user of VRChat, I would like to have raw access to audio streams from the Unity Runtime.\n\nThe granularity of these streams would map cleanly to the existing audio controls:\n\nUI\n\nWorld\n\nVoices\n\nAvatars\n\nDrones\n\nMy personal use case would be to hand off an audio stream directly to bHaptics' software with World audio only. Other use cases might be a videographer that wishes to have separated streams to downmix later upon mastering.\n\nPrior ticket:\n\nhttps://feedback.vrchat.com/feature-requests/p/world-audio-mirroring",
